<title>USA: Fannie Mae sets $250 mln REMIC 1997-18.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae sets $250 mln REMIC 1997-18.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fannie Mae said it issued $250 million of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities via Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p>REMIC trust 1997-18 is backed by 30-year, 7.5 percent mortgage-backed securities, the agency said.</p>
<p>The issue priced on February 18 and has a settlement date of March 27. It has a weighted average coupon of 8.2 percent and a weighted average maturity of 358 months.</p>
<p>(( N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
